  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "from": 0,
      "duration": 465,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "FirstClub's members get rewards in at least six places across the app.",
          "file": "hook-0.wav",
          "start": 0.7,
          "seconds": 4.063916666666667,
          "from": 21,
          "duration": 122
        },
        {
          "text": "Its one game, Toss and Win, sits in the Profile menu. For a new member, it opens to an empty screen with nothing to play.",
          "file": "hook-1.wav",
          "start": 5.113916666666666,
          "seconds": 7.776125,
          "from": 153,
          "duration": 233
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "title",
      "from": 465,
      "duration": 132,
      "lines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "from": 597,
      "duration": 553,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "This was a twenty-four hour design challenge, and my audit of the live app found the same pattern everywhere.",
          "file": "problem-0.wav",
          "start": 20.5,
          "seconds": 6.449208333333333,
          "from": 615,
          "duration": 193
        },
        {
          "text": "Nearly every reward asked members for something first, a toss can land on the losing side, and nothing gave people a reason to come back between orders.",
          "file": "problem-1.wav",
          "start": 27.299208333333333,
          "seconds": 9.44825,
          "from": 819,
          "duration": 283
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "insight",
      "from": 1150,
      "duration": 169,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Plenty of rewards.",
          "file": "insight-0.wav",
          "start": 38.833333333333336,
          "seconds": 1.2319583333333333,
          "from": 1165,
          "duration": 37
        },
        {
          "text": "No reason to come back tomorrow.",
          "file": "insight-1.wav",
          "start": 40.41529166666667,
          "seconds": 1.9612083333333334,
          "from": 1212,
          "duration": 59
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision1",
      "from": 1319,
      "duration": 460,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I compared four places for a daily reward on Home, and picked the one members already use.",
          "file": "decision1-0.wav",
          "start": 44.766666666666666,
          "seconds": 5.499083333333333,
          "from": 1343,
          "duration": 165
        },
        {
          "text": "A small wax seal appears on the gift icon only when there's one to open, and the old Toss and Win row still leads there.",
          "file": "decision1-1.wav",
          "start": 50.61575,
          "seconds": 7.477875,
          "from": 1518,
          "duration": 224
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision2",
      "from": 1779,
      "duration": 497,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The seal comes from FirstClub's own Approved stamp. Opening one takes a press and hold for under a second.",
          "file": "decision2-0.wav",
          "start": 60.099999999999994,
          "seconds": 6.557,
          "from": 1803,
          "duration": 197
        },
        {
          "text": "A ring fills, the seal cracks, and there's always something useful inside, with nothing to buy first and no countdown.",
          "file": "decision2-1.wav",
          "start": 67.00699999999999,
          "seconds": 7.467083333333333,
          "from": 2010,
          "duration": 224
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision3",
      "from": 2276,
      "duration": 409,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Instead of a streak that resets, any five seals in a week earn a Golden Seal, and members choose the gift.",
          "file": "decision3-0.wav",
          "start": 76.66666666666666,
          "seconds": 6.455041666666666,
          "from": 2300,
          "duration": 194
        },
        {
          "text": "Rewards then apply on their own in the cart, with nothing extra to unlock.",
          "file": "decision3-1.wav",
          "start": 83.47170833333332,
          "seconds": 4.625,
          "from": 2504,
          "duration": 139
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "from": 2685,
      "duration": 493,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "In a day, I delivered the audit, the main flow, nine edge cases and a clickable prototype, built with AI.",
          "file": "result-0.wav",
          "start": 90.3,
          "seconds": 7.05475,
          "from": 2709,
          "duration": 212
        },
        {
          "text": "It isn't built, so next I'd test the hold with members and measure orders against a holdout group.",
          "file": "result-1.wav",
          "start": 97.70475,
          "seconds": 5.842958333333334,
          "from": 2931,
          "duration": 175
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "takeaway",
      "from": 3178,
      "duration": 174,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Most of the work was finding what the app already had, and connecting it.",
